      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "§3Immersive Vehicles§r adds cars, trucks, planes, boats and more, all built from parts.\n\n- Vehicles and their parts - engines, wheels, seats, propellers, instruments - are crafted at their own benches, such as the §3Vehicle Bench§r, §3Engine Bench§r and §3Wheel Bench§r.\n- Place the vehicle, then right-click it with the parts to install them. The §6Wrench§r removes parts and opens the vehicle\u0027s info screen; the §6Screwdriver§r is used for some parts as well.\n- Vehicles run on fuel. Fill them with a §3Fuel Pump§r or a §6Jerrycan§r, and lock them with a §6Key§r.\n- The car and plane §6Handbooks§r explain the controls and every system in detail.\n\nThe pack also includes the §6NTM Vehicles§r and §6MTS40k§r content packs.",
